                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Quite a fun Indy title, satisfying to click around and collect peaches. Great for anyone who wants a game they can play with just the mouse. \n\nCan be a bit glitchy at times, but for a new release it runs really well, hasn't crashed on me yet. If i had to improve anything i would add more resolution options, as i had to run the game windowed due to my native resolution not being supported.\n\nOverall a brilliant game for the money, and i would recommend picking it up for such a low price!",
